        "Content": "105 Keeper Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nAsking Price: €525,000 | 2/3 Bed | 1 Bath | Terraced | Turnkey Condition | BER: B\r\n\r\nDescription\r\nKW Castles is delighted to present No. 105 Keeper Road, Drimnagh, to the market.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful two/three-bedroom terraced home is presented in turnkey condition throughout, having been recently renovated and upgraded to an exceptionally high standard by its current owners.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this property is its B energy rating, which not only ensures a warm and energy-efficient home but also qualifies buyers for lower-cost Green Mortgage rates.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, No. 105 boasts a spacious, light-filled extension, creating a superb open-plan living space that flows seamlessly onto a private, low-maintenance suntrap garden which is not overlooked. Complete with secure off-street parking for up to two cars to the front, this home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers and those seeking a stylish, move-in-ready property in a mature, well-connected neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance & Living Space: Warm and welcoming entrance hall leading into the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nRear Extension: A stunning, light-filled open-plan extension that serves as the main living area. Double doors lead out onto the private rear patio garden.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedrooms 1 & 2: Two beautifully finished, well-proportioned double bedrooms.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom: A modern, newly upgraded family bathroom with contemporary fixtures and fittings.\r\n\r\nSecond Floor\r\nAttic Conversion: Converted to a high standard, this highly versatile space features ample light and storage, making it ideal for a home office, playroom, or guest accommodation.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nRear Garden: A private, fully enclosed rear garden that acts as a natural suntrap. Perfect for al fresco dining and completely private (not overlooked).\r\n\r\nFront Driveway: Paved driveway offering secure off-street parking for up to 2 cars.\r\n\r\nLocation & Amenities\r\nIdeally situated just off Herberton Road, No. 105 offers the perfect balance of quiet suburban living and city convenience.\r\n\r\nCity Access: Located just 3.5km from Grafton Street, with the Suir Road and Rialto LUAS stops both within easy walking distance. Numerous bus routes also offer direct access to the city centre.\r\n\r\nShopping & Convenience: A wide range of local amenities are close by, including the highly anticipated new Dunnes Stores anchor development, alongside established cafés and local shops.\r\n\r\nHealthcare: Within close proximity to major medical facilities, including The Coombe Hospital, St. James’s Hospital, and the new Children’s Hospital.\r\n\r\nLeisure & Schools: Brickfield Park is just a short stroll away, alongside a variety of local GAA and soccer clubs. A fine selection of highly-regarded primary and secondary schools are also within the immediate catchment area.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nImmaculate 2/3-bedroom terraced home in turnkey condition.\r\n\r\nEnergy-efficient BER B rating — qualifies for Green Mortgages.\r\n\r\nGenerous rear extension creating a bright, open living space.\r\n\r\nSuperb attic conversion suitable for a home office or guest bedroom.\r\n\r\nPrivate, low-maintenance rear garden (not overlooked).\r\n\r\nSecure off-street parking for up to 2 cars.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable location walking distance to the LUAS, Grand Canal, and Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nProperty Facilities\r\nOff-Street Parking (2 Cars)\r\n\r\nGas Fired Central Heating (GFCH)\r\n\r\nDouble Glazed Windows\r\n\r\nModern Rear Extension\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion\r\n\r\nClose to LUAS & Public Transport Links"
      },
